Firewall record for pypy/module/_metatensor/rule_leave.py

Written 2026-09-23 in a separate agent session, started for this purpose and
given only: the semantics of the leave event (in words), the signature
leave(group, pending, p, reason), and permission to read exactly one file,
pypy/module/_metatensor/motion_iface.py.  It was told not to open, list or
search anything else in the repository, and not to run git.

Its own record of every tool call it made:
  1. Read  pypy/module/_metatensor/motion_iface.py
  2. Write pypy/module/_metatensor/rule_leave.py

The file is committed alone, unmodified from what that session wrote, so the
commit that introduces it is the audit's second witness beside
benchmark/paper/audit_rules.py (imports and vocabulary).
